=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ PCRE2 @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt PCRE2 @VERSION@ (Perl-compatible regular expressions) for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt PCRE2 is distributed under the BSD licence with the PCRE2 exception.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [PCRE2.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for PCRE2
    At system startup: to define PCRE2$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:PCRE2$STARTUP.COM
    Building against PCRE2: compile with
    /NAMES=(AS_IS,SHORTENED)/INCLUDE=PCRE2$ROOT:[INCLUDE]/DEFINE=PCRE2_CODE_UNIT_WIDTH=8
    and link with PCRE2$ROOT:[LIB]PCRE2-8.OLB/LIBRARY.

PRODUCT REMOVE PCRE2 removes the product and deassigns PCRE2$ROOT.
